00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Thomas Green: Welcome everyone to the Quarterly Security Review. Thomas, please kick off with the Q3 breach assessment summary.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Travis Wood: Our penetration testing identified zero critical findings this quarter, a major improvement.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Joanne Simpson: Excellent news! Does this mean we can proceed with the new encryption protocol launch?

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.000
Thomas Green: Yes, but let''s review the rollout plan once more before final approval.', '<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
