00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Michelle Jenkins: Almost. I''m just finalizing the resource allocation numbers. The design is locked.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Christina Oliver: Fantastic. We need that finalized before the executive sync tomorrow morning.', '<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
