00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
James Hill89: Wanda, can you review the Q4 spending proposal? We need to finalize the budget before the board meeting.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Wanda Harrington: I''m reviewing it now. The R&D sector acquisition budget seems slightly over-allocated.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Jeremy Rogers: I can adjust those R&D numbers. We gained efficiency in the last month that wasn''t factored in.', '<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
